<Defs>
  <!--
    Medal system is Def-driven (see docs/设计文档/功能模块/勋章体系/勋章体系架构方案.md §6).
    Phase 1 scope: 6.1~6.4 threshold medals only (27), channel B display bonus +
    gold announcement. 6.5 workshops and 6.6 rank medals are phase 2; 勤俭标兵
    (Thrifty) is skipped until its threshold metric is defined.

    Medal labels/descriptions are translation keys derived from defName:
      UI.Medal.<defName>.Label / UI.Medal.<defName>.Desc
    MedalBuffDef.displayBonus is also a translation key (UI.Medal.Buff.*).

    Channel A (statDefName) stays empty in phase 1 — injection is phase 3 and
    requires reflection verification before the defName is filled in.
  -->

